; Mirrors the VS Code token colors for txt-custom:
; comments / backticks / fences -> grey, strings -> green,
; keys and flags -> orange, brackets -> yellow (via theme_overrides)
(comment) @comment
(backtick) @comment
(fence) @comment
(string) @string
(key) @txtcustom.key
(flag) @txtcustom.flag
(bracket) @txtcustom.bracket
